{"delay_ms":0,"frame":{"classification":"C2","ledger_seq":null,"ns":[],"payload":{"kind":"brief","path":"llm","reason":null,"rendered":"Crew pre-positioning at Sandhill and Millpond yards binds first: it is due by 27 Sep 00:00Z (range 26 Sep 23:00Z to 27 Sep 01:15Z), to stay ahead of the consequence at 27 Sep 05:00Z, since staging needs 300 min. The fuel truck dispatch to PS-17 is due by 28 Sep 14:59Z. The generator hookup there is bound by 27 Sep 03:29Z, and the platform's computation shows decide_now, to protect hospital connection pressure against the floor of 25 psi. Cedarfall pressure hold depends on that hookup, effective 27 Sep 05:59Z. A pre-staged generator is what makes the boil water advisory avoidable, with notice due 27 Sep 03:10Z. These are proposals: the cross-domain priority sits with command and water_operations at T3, and the advisory with water_operations and compliance at T3.","slots":{"E1.consequence":"27 Sep 05:00Z","E1.decide_by":"27 Sep 00:00Z","E1.decide_by_p10":"26 Sep 23:00Z","E1.decide_by_p90":"27 Sep 01:15Z","E1.lead_time":"300 min","E10.due":"27 Sep 03:10Z","E11.approver_functions":"water_operations and compliance","E11.tier":"T3","E2.decide_by":"28 Sep 14:59Z","E3.effective_decide_by":"27 Sep 03:29Z","E4.effective_decide_by":"27 Sep 05:59Z","E6.floor":"25 psi","E9.approver_functions":"command and water_operations","E9.tier":"T3"}},"run_id":"run-7172093948c6","run_mode":"replay","scenario_time":null,"seq":48,"ts":"2026-11-22T11:53:22.044852Z","type":"artifact","v":1},"id":"run:run-7172093948c6.1795348399.48"}
{"delay_ms":0,"frame":{"classification":"C2","ledger_seq":null,"ns":[],"payload":{"action_type":"cross_domain_priority","kind":"rationale","path":"llm","rendered":"The binding clock is 27 Sep 03:59Z, with the effective deadline at 27 Sep 03:29Z and a hookup lead time of 150 min, so the portable generator hookup at PS-17 (DC-D3-PS17-POWER) is flagged decide now. If this is late, pressure at the service connection of HSP-AIK-TALLOWBRANCH may drop below the floor of 25 psi, with a breach probability of 15.2% and 34.5% if power is lost, while the hookup lag is 150 min. The priority rule for FDR-AIK-2207 counts 1,840 customers plus the hospital through its water, and this proposal waits for command and water_operations at tier T3.","structured":{"evidence_ids":["E3","E6","E8","E9"],"preconditions":["generator_ready","crews_available","fuel_path_open","pressure_floor_held","yard_outside_hazard_zone"],"rationale":"The binding clock is {E3.decide_by}, with the effective deadline at {E3.effective_decide_by} and a hookup lead time of {E3.lead_time}, so the portable generator hookup at PS-17 (DC-D3-PS17-POWER) is flagged decide now. If this is late, pressure at the service connection of HSP-AIK-TALLOWBRANCH may drop below the floor of {E6.floor}, with a breach probability of {E6.breach_p} and {E6.breach_given_loss_p} if power is lost, while the hookup lag is {E6.hookup_lag}. The priority rule for FDR-AIK-2207 counts {E8.ce_customers} customers plus the hospital through its water, and this proposal waits for {E9.approver_functions} at tier {E9.tier}."}},"run_id":"run-7172093948c6","run_mode":"replay","scenario_time":null,"seq":49,"ts":"2026-11-22T11:53:22.044856Z","type":"artifact","v":1},"id":"run:run-7172093948c6.1795348399.49"}
{"delay_ms":0,"frame":{"classification":"C2","ledger_seq":null,"ns":[],"payload":{"action_type":"boil_water_notice","kind":"rationale","path":"llm","rendered":"The state boil water rule fires for the Cedarfall zone and the advisory is due 27 Sep 03:10Z, ahead of landfall at 27 Sep 03:10Z, under clause SC DES, Boil Water Notices and Advisories (2024): advisory prior to a hurricane making landfall with threshold 10.0%. If it is late, pressure at the hospital service connection could fall below the floor of 25 psi; the forecast chance of a breach is 15.2%, rising to 34.5% if power is lost (power loss chance 44.2%) with a generator hookup lag of 150 min. The rule marks this notice as avoidable by pre-staging the generator, and a shorter lag lowers the breach chance, from 7.6% at 120 min to 6.5% at 90 min and 6.5% at 60 min. This proposal waits for the T3 decision by water_operations and compliance. If the generator is pre-staged under the cross-domain priority proposal and hooked up within 60 min of a loss, the forecast chance falls to 6.5%, below the 10.0% threshold, so the advisory may not be needed.","structured":{"evidence_ids":["E10","E6","E7","E11"],"preconditions":["advisory_confirms_track","generator_ready","pressure_floor_held","crews_available"],"rationale":"The state boil water rule fires for the Cedarfall zone and the advisory is due {E10.due}, ahead of landfall at {E10.landfall}, under clause {E10.clause} with threshold {E10.threshold}. If it is late, pressure at the hospital service connection could fall below the floor of {E6.floor}; the forecast chance of a breach is {E6.breach_p}, rising to {E6.breach_given_loss_p} if power is lost (power loss chance {E6.power_loss_p}) with a generator hookup lag of {E6.hookup_lag}. The rule marks this notice as avoidable by pre-staging the generator, and a shorter lag lowers the breach chance, from {E7.breach_p_lag_120} at {E7.lag_120} to {E7.breach_p_lag_90} at {E7.lag_90} and {E7.breach_p_lag_60} at {E7.lag_60}. This proposal waits for the {E11.tier} decision by {E11.approver_functions}."}},"run_id":"run-7172093948c6","run_mode":"replay","scenario_time":null,"seq":50,"ts":"2026-11-22T11:53:22.044861Z","type":"artifact","v":1},"id":"run:run-7172093948c6.1795348399.50"}
